    "description": {
      "value": "A ray of energy bludgeons your target into submission without causing lasting harm. When you cast this spell, you choose whether the ray feels like a strong punch or slap. Make a spell attack roll. The ray deals 2d6 bludgeoning damage.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target takes double damage.\n- **Success:** The target takes full damage."
